+### Plugin sections
+
+Plugins register root-scoped list entries in `sidebar.sections` after native Workspace browsing and before the footer. Each entry receives `wide` and `expandSidebar`, owns its section layout, and is removed when its registration is disposed. This seat adds navigation without replacing native Workspace, panel, footer-action or Settings entries. With no occupants, it renders no content or spacing.
+
